{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019Sio8JvwzbCeyd43oyg1xP","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Gold validation (κ=0.76, N=650) reveals ~22% of MV labels are\n2\t  incorrect — predominantly semantically diverse stagnation that LFs miss. Structural\n3\t  features collapse from 0.995→0.78-0.80 on gold (20pp circular evaluation tax); probe\n4\t  drops only 0.906→0.82 (-8.6pp) and surpasses structural on gold. LLM-judge few-shot\n5\t  (0.81) pulls even with probe and structural. Overlap ablation confirms >55% of structural\n6\t  advantage was circular (residual F1=0.70). Instance-isolated cross-agent GB drops\n7\t  from 0.967→0.89, and probe-10%FT now surpasses it (0.91). Paper must pivot completely:\n8\t  \"structural dominance\" → \"circular evaluation as systematic risk in WS for sequential\n9\t  data.\" Primary contributions become (1) 650-window annotated benchmark, (2) quantification\n10\t  of circular evaluation bias, (3) probe''s surprising gold-robustness as evidence\n11\t  that embeddings learn beyond LF heuristics. Structural retains value only as zero-data\n12\t  baseline in strict no-target-data deployment. TLM negative finding (Claim 3) unchanged.\n13\t  Target EMNLP Findings as methodology/analysis + resource paper.\n14\t\n15\t  '\n16\timagined_experiments:\n17\t- name: gold-set\n18\t  plan_id: gold-set\n19\t  description: '650 windows human-annotated from SWE-agent conf≥2 (stratified sample\n20\t    from 15401). Two annotators + adjudication. All trained methods re-evaluated against\n21\t    gold labels. GO/NO-GO gate for paper framing.\n22\t\n23\t    '\n24\t  expected_results:\n25\t    gold_n_windows: 650\n26\t    gold_kappa: 0.76\n27\t    gold_adjudication_rate: 0.31\n28\t    gold_stag_count: 201\n29\t    gold_prog_count: 449\n30\t    gold_stag_rate: 0.309\n31\t    mv_stag_rate_on_gold_sample: 0.265\n32\t    gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.78\n33\t    gold_mv_agreement_n: 507\n34\t    gold_mv_disagree_n: 143\n35\t    disagree_mv_prog_gold_stag: 86\n36\t    disagree_mv_stag_gold_prog: 57\n37\t    disagree_dominated_by_missed_stag_pct: 60.1\n38\t    structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.78\n39\t    structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.68\n40\t    structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.88\n41\t    structural_rf_gold_accuracy: 0.81\n42\t    structural_rf_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9951\n43\t    structural_rf_gold_drop_pp: -21.5\n44\t    structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.8\n45\t    structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.71\n46\t    structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n47\t    structural_gb_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n48\t    structural_gb_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9951\n49\t    structural_gb_gold_drop_pp: -19.5\n50\t    probe_qwen_gold_macro_f1: 0.82\n51\t    probe_qwen_gold_f1_stag: 0.76\n52\t    probe_qwen_gold_f1_prog: 0.88\n53\t    probe_qwen_gold_accuracy: 0.84\n54\t    probe_qwen_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9055\n55\t    probe_qwen_gold_drop_pp: -8.6\n56\t    probe_e5_gold_macro_f1: 0.83\n57\t    probe_e5_gold_f1_stag: 0.77\n58\t    probe_e5_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n59\t    probe_e5_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9363\n60\t    probe_e5_gold_drop_pp: -10.6\n61\t    probe_bge_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n62\t    probe_bge_gold_f1_stag: 0.78\n63\t    probe_bge_gold_f1_prog: 0.9\n64\t    probe_bge_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9413\n65\t    probe_bge_gold_drop_pp: -10.1\n66\t    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.73\n67\t    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.66\n68\t    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.8\n69\t    llm_judge_zeroshot_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.6625\n70\t    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_gain_pp: 6.8\n71\t    twv_labels_gold_macro_f1: 0.72\n72\t    twv_labels_gold_mv_agreement: 0.74\n73\t    twv_labels_vs_mv_gold_delta_pp: -6.0\n74\t    twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8\n75\t    twv_probe_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9517\n76\t    twv_probe_gold_drop_pp: -15.2\n77\t    structural_gb_minus_probe_qwen_gold_pp: -2.0\n78\t    structural_gb_minus_probe_bge_gold_pp: -4.0\n79\t    structural_gb_minus_llm_zs_gold_pp: 7.0\n80\t    disagree_structural_rf_macro_f1: 0.36\n81\t    disagree_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.39\n82\t    disagree_probe_qwen_macro_f1: 0.53\n83\t    disagree_probe_bge_macro_f1: 0.56\n84\t    disagree_llm_judge_zs_macro_f1: 0.49\n85\t    probe_fp_on_lf_validated_by_gold_pct: 0.42\n86\t    structural_fp_on_lf_validated_by_gold_pct: 0.07\n87\t    gold_stag_rate_vs_mv_stag_rate_delta: +4.4pp\n88\t    gold_finds_more_stagnation: true\n89\t  result_rationale: 'Gold-MV agreement 78% 意味着 ~22% 的 MV 标签错误。143 个分歧窗口中 86 个 (60%)\n90\t    是 MV=progress 但 gold=stagnation——LFs 系统性地漏掉了 \"语义多样停滞\"（agent 执行多样命令 + 修改文件，看起来像\n91\t    progress，但人工标注者判定为无效）。另外 57 个 (40%) 是 MV=stag 但 gold=progress——agent 重复命令模式但实际在推进。Gold\n92\t    停滞率 (30.9%) 高于 MV (26.5%)， 证实 LFs 低估停滞。\n93\t\n94\t    Structural RF/GB 从 0.995 暴跌到 0.78-0.80（-19.5~-21.5pp），因为结构特征本质上学会了 LF→label 映射；LF\n95\t    错时，structural 跟着错。在 143 个分歧窗口上 structural 仅 0.36-0.39 macro_f1——基本跟随 MV 的错误判断。\n96\t\n97\t    Probe 仅从 0.906 降到 0.82（-8.6pp），降幅远小于 structural。关键发现：probe 之前在 LF 标签上的 FP（预测 stag\n98\t    但 LF 说 progress）中有 42% 被 gold 验证为正确的 stagnation ——probe 通过语义表征学到了超越 LF 启发式的真实信号。在分歧窗口上\n99\t    probe 达到 0.53， 远超 structural 的 0.39。三个 encoder (Qwen/E5/BGE) 在 gold 上均超过 structural，\n100\t    其中 BGE 最高 (0.84)。\n101\t\n102\t    LLM judge zero-shot 在 gold 上反而提升 +6.8pp（0.6625→0.73），因为 LLM 之前的部分 \"错误\" （与 LF 不一致）实际是正确的人类判断。但\n103\t    0.73 仍低于 probe 和 structural。\n104\t\n105\t    TWV 标签在 gold 上比 MV 更差（0.72 vs 0.78），因为 TWV 的时序平滑传播了 LF 的系统性 偏差。TWV-probe 同样受损（0.80），低于直接\n106\t    MV 训练的 probe（0.82）。\n107\t\n108\t    κ=0.76 处于可接受但偏低的水平——约 15% 的窗口存在标注者分歧需裁决，反映停滞边界的 内在模糊性。这本身也是论文的发现：stagnation 不是简单的\n109\t    binary concept。\n110\t\n111\t    '\n112\t  tables:\n113\t  - name: 'Table 1: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)'\n114\t    columns:\n115\t    - Method\n116\t    - LF_Macro_F1\n117\t    - Gold_Macro_F1\n118\t    - Δ_pp\n119\t    - Gold_F1_Stag\n120\t    - Gold_F1_Prog\n121\t    rows:\n122\t    - - Structural RF\n123\t      - 0.9951\n124\t      - 0.78\n125\t      - -21.5\n126\t      - 0.68\n127\t      - 0.88\n128\t    - - Structural GB\n129\t      - 0.9951\n130\t      - 0.8\n131\t      - -19.5\n132\t      - 0.71\n133\t      - 0.89\n134\t    - - Probe (Qwen)\n135\t      - 0.9055\n136\t      - 0.82\n137\t      - -8.6\n138\t      - 0.76\n139\t      - 0.88\n140\t    - - Probe (E5)\n141\t      - 0.9363\n142\t      - 0.83\n143\t      - -10.6\n144\t      - 0.77\n145\t      - 0.89\n146\t    - - Probe (BGE)\n147\t      - 0.9413\n148\t      - 0.84\n149\t      - -10.1\n150\t      - 0.78\n151\t      - 0.9\n152\t    - - LLM Judge 0-shot\n153\t      - 0.6625\n154\t      - 0.73\n155\t      - 6.8\n156\t      - 0.66\n157\t      - 0.8\n158\t    - - TWV Labels\n159\t      - —\n160\t      - 0.72\n161\t      - —\n162\t      - 0.63\n163\t      - 0.81\n164\t    - - TWV Probe\n165\t      - 0.9517\n166\t      - 0.8\n167\t      - -15.2\n168\t      - 0.73\n169\t      - 0.87\n170\t    - - MV Labels\n171\t      - 1.0\n172\t      - 0.78\n173\t      - —\n174\t      - —\n175\t      - —\n176\t  - name: 'Table 2: Gold-MV Disagreement Breakdown (N=143)'\n177\t    columns:\n178\t    - Type\n179\t    - Count\n180\t    - Pct\n181\t    - Dominant_LF_Pattern\n182\t    - Interpretation\n183\t    rows:\n184\t    - - MV=prog → gold=stag\n185\t      - 86\n186\t      - 60.1\n187\t      - cmd_rep=0 ∧ file_diff=1\n188\t      - 'LFs miss semantic stagnation: diverse actions with file changes but no goal-directed\n189\t        progress'\n190\t    - - MV=stag → gold=prog\n191\t      - 57\n192\t      - 39.9\n193\t      - cmd_rep=1 ∧ OB=0\n194\t      - 'LFs over-call: repetitive commands that are actually productive (e.g., iterative\n195\t        testing)'\n196\t  - name: 'Table 3: Method Performance on Disagreement Windows (N=143)'\n197\t    columns:\n198\t    - Method\n199\t    - Disagree_Macro_F1\n200\t    - Follows_Gold_Pct\n201\t    - Follows_MV_Pct\n202\t    rows:\n203\t    - - Structural RF\n204\t      - 0.36\n205\t      - 35.7\n206\t      - 64.3\n207\t    - - Structural GB\n208\t      - 0.39\n209\t      - 38.5\n210\t      - 61.5\n211\t    - - Probe (Qwen)\n212\t      - 0.53\n213\t      - 52.4\n214\t      - 47.6\n215\t    - - Probe (BGE)\n216\t      - 0.56\n217\t      - 55.2\n218\t      - 44.8\n219\t    - - LLM Judge 0-shot\n220\t      - 0.49\n221\t      - 48.3\n222\t      - 51.7\n223\t  - name: 'Table 4: Probe FP Re-evaluation Against Gold'\n224\t    columns:\n225\t    - Probe_Error_Type_on_LF\n226\t    - Count_in_Gold_Sample\n227\t    - Gold_Validates_Pct\n228\t    - Interpretation\n229\t    rows:\n230\t    - - FP (probe=stag, LF=prog)\n231\t      - 48\n232\t      - 42\n233\t      - Probe detected real stagnation that LFs missed\n234\t    - - FN (probe=prog, LF=stag)\n235\t      - 22\n236\t      - 18\n237\t      - Small portion of probe FN also wrong per gold\n238\t  figures_description:\n239\t  - 'Fig A: Scatter plot — LF_Macro_F1 (x) vs Gold_Macro_F1 (y) for all methods. Structural\n240\t    methods far below y=x line (massive gold penalty); probes closer to y=x; LLM judge\n241\t    above y=x (improves on gold). Dashed line y=x highlights circular evaluation tax.'\n242\t  - 'Fig B: Grouped bar chart — F1_stag by method, LF labels vs gold labels side-by-side.\n243\t    Structural stag-F1 collapses from 0.99→0.68-0.71; probe stag-F1 drops less (0.86→0.76-0.78).\n244\t    Visualizes where structural fails most.'\n245\t  - 'Fig C: Confusion matrix heatmaps (2×2) for structural GB and probe on gold —\n246\t    structural shows massive FN block (gold=stag, pred=prog); probe shows more balanced\n247\t    errors.'\n248\t  - 'Fig D: Disagreement window analysis — stacked bars showing what fraction of each\n249\t    method''s predictions align with gold vs MV on the 143 contested windows. Probe\n250\t    aligns more with gold; structural aligns more with MV.'\n251\t  - 'Fig E: Distribution of probe prediction probability on gold-validated vs gold-rejected\n252\t    FP windows — bimodal: probe is confident on gold-validated FPs (mean prob 0.91),\n253\t    less confident on truly-wrong FPs (mean prob 0.72).'\n254\t  analysis: 'Gold set 结果确认 worst 档：structural dominance 是 circular evaluation artifact。\n255\t\n256\t    核心证据链：(1) MV 与 gold 仅 78% 一致——22% 窗口上 LF 标签错误，以漏标语义停滞为主； (2) Structural 在 LF 标签上\n257\t    0.995 暴跌到 gold 上 0.78-0.80，因为 structural 本质是 LF 逆向工程器——它学会了 \"cmd_rep high → stag,\n258\t    file_diff high → prog\" 这套规则， 但这套规则在 22% 窗口上是错的；(3) Probe 在 gold 上 0.82-0.84，超过\n259\t    structural 2-4pp—— 语义表征学到了超越 LF 启发式的信号；(4) Probe 之前的 FP (on LF) 中 42% 被 gold 验证\n260\t    为正确——probe 的 \"错误模式\" 恰好是 gold 认为正确的模式；(5) LLM judge 在 gold 上提升， 进一步确认 LF 标签偏差而非方法本身的问题。\n261\t\n262\t    论文 reframe 方向：Claim 1 从 \"structural dominance\" 转为 \"circular evaluation as systematic\n263\t    risk\"——30 个结构特征在 LF-derived labels 上 0.995 是问题的量化，不是成就。 Claim 2 变为 \"probe gold-robustness\"——embedding-based\n264\t    detectors 在噪声标签训练下 仍保留超越 LF 的信号。650-window benchmark 成为论文最重要的 resource contribution。\n265\t\n266\t    风险与对策：κ=0.76 偏低可能被 reviewer 质疑标注质量——需要展示 adjudication 流程 + 分歧案例分析证明 κ 低是因为任务内在模糊性，不是标注者不称职。Gold\n267\t    样本 N=650 占 conf≥2 的 4.2%——reviewer 可能要求更大样本——对策是展示 3-seed 子采样稳定性 (std<0.01)。\n268\t\n269\t    '\n270\t- name: llm-judge-fewshot\n271\t  plan_id: llm-judge-fewshot\n272\t  description: 'LLM-as-judge with 5-shot examples (2 stagnation + 2 progress + 1 ambiguous\n273\t    boundary case) + chain-of-thought prompting. Claude Sonnet 4. Evaluated on 650\n274\t    gold windows.\n275\t\n276\t    '\n277\t  expected_results:\n278\t    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.81\n279\t    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.75\n280\t    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.87\n281\t    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n282\t    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_precision_stag: 0.78\n283\t    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_recall_stag: 0.72\n284\t    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1_ref: 0.73\n285\t    fewshot_vs_zeroshot_gold_delta_pp: 8.0\n286\t    fewshot_vs_structural_gb_gold_delta_pp: 1.0\n287\t    fewshot_vs_probe_qwen_gold_delta_pp: -1.0\n288\t    fewshot_vs_probe_bge_gold_delta_pp: -3.0\n289\t    api_cost_usd: 15.2\n290\t    total_tokens: 4350000\n291\t    mean_cot_length_tokens: 187\n292\t    parse_failures: 2\n293\t  result_rationale: 'Few-shot examples 教会 LLM \"语义停滞\" 的具体表现——agent 做了多样但无效的操作序列 ——这正是\n294\t    gold 标注者捕捉但 LF 遗漏的模式。CoT 强迫 LLM 显式推理 \"这些操作是否 朝目标推进\"，将 stag recall 从 zero-shot\n295\t    的 ~0.58 提升到 0.72。\n296\t\n297\t    0.81 的 gold F1 与 probe (0.82) 和 structural GB (0.80) 在统计上不可区分——三种 截然不同的方法在 gold\n298\t    上收敛到相同水平。这是 worst 档的关键发现：structural 在 LF 标签上领先 LLM +33pp（0.995 vs 0.663），但在 gold\n299\t    上反而落后 1pp（0.80 vs 0.81） ——\"dominance\" 完全是 circular artifact。\n300\t\n301\t    Cost 从 $11.66 升到 $15.20（+30%），因为 5-shot examples + CoT chain 增加了 prompt 长度。但 LLM\n302\t    的主要劣势不是 cost 而是 stag precision 偏低（0.78）——LLM 倾向于 将探索性行为误判为停滞（aggressive stagnation\n303\t    caller），few-shot examples 部分 缓解但未完全解决。\n304\t\n305\t    '\n306\t  tables:\n307\t  - name: 'Table: LLM Judge Variants vs Other Methods on Gold (N=650)'\n308\t    columns:\n309\t    - Method\n310\t    - Gold_Macro_F1\n311\t    - Gold_F1_Stag\n312\t    - Gold_Recall_Stag\n313\t    - Cost_USD\n314\t    rows:\n315\t    - - LLM 0-shot\n316\t      - 0.73\n317\t      - 0.66\n318\t      - 0.58\n319\t      - 11.66\n320\t    - - LLM 5-shot+CoT\n321\t      - 0.81\n322\t      - 0.75\n323\t      - 0.72\n324\t      - 15.2\n325\t    - - Structural GB\n326\t      - 0.8\n327\t      - 0.71\n328\t      - 0.63\n329\t      - 0.0\n330\t    - - Probe (Qwen)\n331\t      - 0.82\n332\t      - 0.76\n333\t      - 0.71\n334\t      - 0.0\n335\t    - - Probe (BGE)\n336\t      - 0.84\n337\t      - 0.78\n338\t      - 0.74\n339\t      - 0.0\n340\t  - name: 'Table: LF-Label vs Gold-Label Performance Spread'\n341\t    columns:\n342\t    - Method\n343\t    - LF_Macro_F1\n344\t    - Gold_Macro_F1\n345\t    - Δ_pp\n346\t    - Rank_on_LF\n347\t    - Rank_on_Gold\n348\t    rows:\n349\t    - - Structural GB\n350\t      - 0.9951\n351\t      - 0.8\n352\t      - -19.5\n353\t      - 1\n354\t      - 4\n355\t    - - Structural RF\n356\t      - 0.9951\n357\t      - 0.78\n358\t      - -21.5\n359\t      - 1\n360\t      - 5\n361\t    - - Probe (BGE)\n362\t      - 0.9413\n363\t      - 0.84\n364\t      - -10.1\n365\t      - 3\n366\t      - 1\n367\t    - - Probe (Qwen)\n368\t      - 0.9055\n369\t      - 0.82\n370\t      - -8.6\n371\t      - 4\n372\t      - 2\n373\t    - - LLM 5-shot+CoT\n374\t      - ~0.74†\n375\t      - 0.81\n376\t      - +7.0†\n377\t      - 5\n378\t      - 3\n379\t    - - LLM 0-shot\n380\t      - 0.6625\n381\t      - 0.73\n382\t      - 6.8\n383\t      - 6\n384\t      - 6\n385\t  figures_description:\n386\t  - 'Fig: Rank reversal visualization — parallel coordinates plot showing method rankings\n387\t    on LF labels (left axis) vs gold labels (right axis). Structural drops from rank\n388\t    1→4/5; probe rises from 3-4→1-2; LLM rises from 5-6→3.'\n389\t  - 'Fig: 2-3 CoT output examples where LLM correctly reasons about semantic stagnation\n390\t    — e.g., ''The agent modified 3 different files and ran unique commands, but each\n391\t    edit reverts or contradicts the previous one, indicating circular problem-solving\n392\t    without convergence.'''\n393\t  analysis: 'LLM few-shot 结果是 structural dominance claim 的致命打击。在 LF 标签上 structural\n394\t    领先 LLM +33pp；在 gold 上 LLM few-shot 反超 structural +1pp。5 个 in-context examples\n395\t    高效传递了 \"语义停滞\" 概念——无需 30 个手工特征 + 训练分类器。\n396\t\n397\t    更深层的意义：三种完全不同的方法路线（hand-crafted features → ML classifier、 frozen embeddings →\n398\t    GRU probe、LLM in-context learning）在 gold 上收敛到 0.80-0.84 区间——这暗示 650 窗口标注集的 \"可达上界\"\n399\t    约 0.84-0.86（受限于标注 ambiguity, κ=0.76）。 所有方法都在逼近人类标注者间一致性的天花板，而非某种方法有本质优势。\n400\t\n401\t    这支持论文 reframe 为 methodology paper：问题不是 \"哪种方法最好\" 而是 \"circular evaluation 如何系统性扭曲方法排序\"。\n402\t\n403\t    '\n404\t- name: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n405\t  plan_id: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n406\t  description: '从 30 维结构特征中移除与 LF 直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关: command_repetition_ratio, unique_command_ratio,\n407\t    repeated_command_count 等; file_diff 相关: file_diff_count, files_modified, diff_size\n408\t    等），测量残差特征在 gold 上的 F1 以隔离非 circular 贡献。\n409\t\n410\t    '\n411\t  expected_results:\n412\t    full_30dim_gold_macro_f1: 0.8\n413\t    full_30dim_lf_macro_f1: 0.9951\n414\t    overlap_features_removed_n: 12\n415\t    overlap_feature_names: 'command_repetition_ratio, unique_command_ratio, repeated_command_count,\n416\t      command_diversity_index, file_diff_count, files_modified, diff_line_count, diff_size_bytes,\n417\t      new_files_created, file_diversity_ratio, cmd_rep_binary, file_diff_binary\n418\t\n419\t      '\n420\t    residual_features_n: 18\n421\t    residual_gold_macro_f1: 0.7\n422\t    residual_gold_f1_stag: 0.6\n423\t    residual_gold_f1_prog: 0.8\n424\t    residual_gold_accuracy: 0.74\n425\t    residual_lf_macro_f1: 0.87\n426\t    residual_lf_f1_stag: 0.82\n427\t    residual_lf_f1_prog: 0.92\n428\t    overlap_only_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n429\t    overlap_only_lf_macro_f1: 0.98\n430\t    overlap_ablation_delta_gold_pp: -10.0\n431\t    overlap_ablation_delta_lf_pp: -12.5\n432\t    residual_vs_probe_qwen_gold_pp: -12.0\n433\t    residual_vs_probe_bge_gold_pp: -14.0\n434\t    residual_vs_random_gold_pp: 20.0\n435\t    top_residual_features:\n436\t    - name: action_diversity_entropy\n437\t      gini_importance: 0.18\n438\t      gold_univariate_f1: 0.62\n439\t    - name: trajectory_position_normalized\n440\t      gini_importance: 0.14\n441\t      gold_univariate_f1: 0.59\n442\t    - name: mean_output_length\n443\t      gini_importance: 0.12\n444\t      gold_univariate_f1: 0.57\n445\t    - name: step_duration_variance\n446\t      gini_importance: 0.09\n447\t      gold_univariate_f1: 0.56\n448\t    - name: action_length_mean\n449\t      gini_importance: 0.08\n450\t      gold_univariate_f1: 0.55\n451\t  result_rationale: '移除 12 个与 LF 计算直接重叠的特征剥离了 circular signal 通路。这 12 个特征本质上是 LF 输入的子集或高度相关变量——cmd_rep\n452\t    LF 直接使用 command_repetition_ratio， file_diff LF 直接使用 file_diff_count。当 evaluation\n453\t    labels 也由这些 LF 生成时， 这些特征天然具有近完美预测力，但这是 tautological 的。\n454\t\n455\t    残差 18 个特征（action diversity entropy、trajectory position、output length 特征等） 在 gold\n456\t    上仅 0.70——比 full structural 低 10pp，比 probe 低 12pp。这证实： structural 在 gold 上的 0.80\n457\t    中，约 10pp（~55%的有效 signal）来自 LF-overlap 特征 的 circular 贡献。\n458\t\n459\t    残差 0.70 仍高于 random (0.50) 20pp——非 overlap 特征确实捕获了一些真实停滞信号。 Action diversity entropy\n460\t    是最强残差特征（gini=0.18）：停滞窗口的动作多样性确实偏低， 这不完全等同于 cmd_rep（低多样性 ≠ 高重复）。Trajectory position\n461\t    也有信号：停滞更多 发生在中后段。但这些信号远不足以与 probe 的语义表征竞争。\n462\t\n463\t    Overlap-only 特征在 gold 上 0.77——高于残差（0.70），因为 cmd_rep 和 file_diff 确实 捕获了真实的停滞信号（重复和无文件变更是停滞的真实指标）。问题不是这些特征无信息量，\n464\t    而是在 LF-derived labels 上评估它们将 0.77 的真实能力膨胀为 0.98。\n465\t\n466\t    在 LF 标签上，残差仍达 0.87（vs 0.995 full），因为即使非 overlap 特征也与 LF 输出 间接相关（如 action_diversity\n467\t    与 cmd_rep 相关 r≈0.6）——这进一步说明 LF-label evaluation 的 circularity 不仅限于直接 overlap 特征。\n468\t\n469\t    '\n470\t  tables:\n471\t  - name: 'Table: Overlap Ablation — LF vs Gold Performance (N=650)'\n472\t    columns:\n473\t    - Feature_Set\n474\t    - N_Feat\n475\t    - LF_Macro_F1\n476\t    - Gold_Macro_F1\n477\t    - LF-Gold_Gap\n478\t    rows:\n479\t    - - Full structural\n480\t      - 30\n481\t      - 0.9951\n482\t      - 0.8\n483\t      - 0.195\n484\t    - - Residual (non-overlap)\n485\t      - 18\n486\t      - 0.87\n487\t      - 0.7\n488\t      - 0.17\n489\t    - - Overlap-only\n490\t      - 12\n491\t      - 0.98\n492\t      - 0.77\n493\t      - 0.21\n494\t    - - Probe Qwen (ref)\n495\t      - —\n496\t      - 0.9055\n497\t      - 0.82\n498\t      - 0.086\n499\t    - - Probe BGE (ref)\n500\t      - —\n501\t      - 0.9413\n502\t      - 0.84\n503\t      - 0.101\n504\t  - name: 'Table: Signal Decomposition on Gold'\n505\t    columns:\n506\t    - Component\n507\t    - Gold_Macro_F1\n508\t    - Contribution_to_Full\n509\t    - Interpretation\n510\t    rows:\n511\t    - - Full structural\n512\t      - 0.8\n513\t      - 100%\n514\t      - Total structural signal on gold\n515\t    - - Overlap features (circular)\n516\t      - 0.77\n517\t      - ~55%†\n518\t      - Circular + genuine mixed signal\n519\t    - - Residual features\n520\t      - 0.7\n521\t      - ~45%†\n522\t      - Genuine non-circular signal only\n523\t    - - '†Note: non-additive decomposition, percentages are approximate via Shapley-style\n524\t        attribution'\n525\t      - ''\n526\t      - ''\n527\t      - ''\n528\t  - name: 'Table: Top-5 Residual Features (Gold-Label Importance)'\n529\t    columns:\n530\t    - Feature\n531\t    - Gini\n532\t    - Gold_Univariate_F1\n533\t    - Correlation_w_cmd_rep\n534\t    rows:\n535\t    - - action_diversity_entropy\n536\t      - 0.18\n537\t      - 0.62\n538\t      - 0.61\n539\t    - - trajectory_position_norm\n540\t      - 0.14\n541\t      - 0.59\n542\t      - 0.08\n543\t    - - mean_output_length\n544\t      - 0.12\n545\t      - 0.57\n546\t      - 0.23\n547\t    - - step_duration_variance\n548\t      - 0.09\n549\t      - 0.56\n550\t      - 0.15\n551\t    - - action_length_mean\n552\t      - 0.08\n553\t      - 0.55\n554\t      - 0.31\n555\t  figures_description:\n556\t  - 'Fig: Stacked bar — structural F1 decomposed into overlap contribution (blue)\n557\t    and residual contribution (orange) on LF labels vs gold labels. On LF labels the\n558\t    blue bar dominates (0.98 vs 0.87); on gold both shrink but blue shrinks more (0.77\n559\t    vs 0.70). Visualizes circularity tax.'\n560\t  - 'Fig: Feature importance comparison heatmap — 30 features × 2 evaluation regimes\n561\t    (LF importance vs gold importance). LF-overlap features show massive importance\n562\t    drop from LF→gold; residual features show modest but stable importance across\n563\t    both.'\n564\t  - 'Fig: Scatter — each structural feature''s LF-label importance (x) vs gold-label\n565\t    importance (y). Points above y=x are ''genuinely important''; points far below\n566\t    are ''circularly inflated''. Overlap features cluster below y=x; most residual\n567\t    features near y=x.'\n568\t  analysis: 'Overlap ablation 是 circular evaluation 的 smoking gun。核心发现：移除 12 个与 LF\n569\t    直接重叠的特征后，structural 在 gold 上从 0.80 跌至 0.70——10pp 的 circular premium。 而 probe 在\n570\t    gold 上 0.82，领先残差 structural 12pp。\n571\t\n572\t    这意味着：如果用一个 \"公平\" 的（non-circular）structural baseline，probe 始终更优。 Structural 的 \"优势\"\n573\t    完全建立在 evaluation circularity 上。\n574\t\n575\t    残差 0.70 > random 0.50 证明 structural 不是完全无用——action diversity、trajectory position\n576\t    等特征确实有信号。但 0.70 的水平显著低于 probe（0.82-0.84），说明这些 hand-crafted 特征远不如 learned semantic\n577\t    representations 有效。\n578\t\n579\t    论文呈现策略：将 overlap ablation 作为 \"circular evaluation 量化\" 的核心实验。 配合 gold validation\n580\t    结果，构建完整的 evidence chain：LF labels 上 structural 0.995 是问题（circular），不是成就（signal）。残差\n581\t    F1 0.70 是 structural 的 \"真实能力\"， 0.995 - 0.70 = 29.5pp 是 circular inflation。但需注意\n582\t    LF 标签上残差 0.87 也受间接 circularity 影响——即使非 overlap 特征也与 LF 输出有相关性。\n583\t\n584\t    '\n585\t- name: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n586\t  plan_id: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n587\t  description: '对 cross-agent structural GB 执行严格的 instance-level 测试隔离——确保 SWE-agent\n588\t    训练集中的 SWE-bench task instance 不出现在 OH 评估集中。消除任务级信息泄漏。\n589\t\n590\t    '\n591\t  expected_results:\n592\t    original_gb_cross_all_macro_f1: 0.9674\n593\t    original_gb_cross_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9919\n594\t    shared_instances_n: 847\n595\t    shared_instances_pct: 28.3\n596\t    shared_instance_windows: 42600\n597\t    non_shared_eval_windows: 108052\n598\t    non_shared_eval_stag_rate: 0.228\n599\t    isolated_gb_macro_f1: 0.89\n600\t    isolated_gb_f1_stag: 0.84\n601\t    isolated_gb_f1_prog: 0.94\n602\t    isolated_gb_accuracy: 0.91\n603\t    isolation_delta_pp: -7.7\n604\t    isolated_rf_macro_f1: 0.86\n605\t    isolated_rf_f1_stag: 0.8\n606\t    isolated_rf_f1_prog: 0.92\n607\t    probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1: 0.58\n608\t    probe_5pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.84\n609\t    probe_10pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.91\n610\t    probe_20pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.94\n611\t    probe_50pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.96\n612\t    structural_gb_minus_probe_zs_isolated_pp: 31.0\n613\t    structural_gb_minus_probe_5ft_isolated_pp: 5.0\n614\t    structural_gb_minus_probe_10ft_isolated_pp: -2.0\n615\t    structural_gb_minus_probe_20ft_isolated_pp: -5.0\n616\t    structural_gb_minus_probe_50ft_isolated_pp: -7.0\n617\t    crossover_point_shifts_from: 50% FT\n618\t    crossover_point_shifts_to: ~8% FT\n619\t    shared_instance_mean_solve_rate: 0.42\n620\t    non_shared_instance_mean_solve_rate: 0.28\n621\t    shared_easier: true\n622\t  result_rationale: '约 28% 的 OH 评估窗口来自与 SWE-agent 训练集共享的 SWE-bench task instance。\n623\t    这些共享任务上，structural features（command patterns、file modification patterns） 天然相似——同一个\n624\t    bug 触发相似的 debugging 命令序列和文件修改，无论用哪个 agent。 因此 structural classifier 在共享任务上的表现被\n625\t    task-level similarity 而非 agent-invariant stagnation patterns 所支撑。\n626\t\n627\t    移除共享实例后，GB 从 0.967 降到 0.89（-7.7pp）。降幅显著但 0.89 仍然 substantial ——structural 确实有跨\n628\t    agent 的迁移能力，只是被高估了。非共享任务更难（平均 solve rate 28% vs 42%），难任务上 stagnation patterns\n629\t    更 diverse、更 agent-specific，导致 structural 特征的迁移效果减弱。\n630\t\n631\t    关键变化在 probe comparison：原始数据中 probe 50% FT 才追平 structural（0.968 ≈ 0.967）， isolation\n632\t    后 probe 10% FT 就超过 structural（0.91 > 0.89, +2pp）。Crossover point 从 50% 前移到 ~8%——probe\n633\t    的语义表征对 task-level variation 更 robust（embedding 编码语义而非表面命令模式）。Probe zero-shot 基本不受影响（0.598→0.58,\n634\t    -1.8pp）， 因为 zero-shot 的瓶颈是 domain shift 而非 task overlap。\n635\t\n636\t    共享实例更容易（solve rate 更高）也意味着原始评估高估了所有方法的 cross-agent 性能， 但 structural 受影响更大——structural\n637\t    的 task-specific pattern matching 在简单任务 上更有效。\n638\t\n639\t    '\n640\t  tables:\n641\t  - name: 'Table: Instance Isolation Impact on Cross-Agent Transfer'\n642\t    columns:\n643\t    - Method\n644\t    - Original_All\n645\t    - Isolated\n646\t    - Δ_pp\n647\t    rows:\n648\t    - - Structural GB\n649\t      - 0.9674\n650\t      - 0.89\n651\t      - -7.7\n652\t    - - Structural RF\n653\t      - 0.9123\n654\t      - 0.86\n655\t      - -5.2\n656\t    - - Probe 0-shot\n657\t      - 0.5984\n658\t      - 0.58\n659\t      - -1.8\n660\t    - - Probe 5% FT\n661\t      - 0.8503\n662\t      - 0.84\n663\t      - -1.0\n664\t    - - Probe 10% FT\n665\t      - 0.9179\n666\t      - 0.91\n667\t      - -0.8\n668\t    - - Probe 20% FT\n669\t      - 0.9475\n670\t      - 0.94\n671\t      - -0.8\n672\t    - - Probe 50% FT\n673\t      - 0.9682\n674\t      - 0.96\n675\t      - -0.8\n676\t  - name: 'Table: Structural vs Probe Crossover Under Instance Isolation'\n677\t    columns:\n678\t    - Comparison\n679\t    - Original_Gap_pp\n680\t    - Isolated_Gap_pp\n681\t    - Shift\n682\t    rows:\n683\t    - - GB vs Probe 0-shot\n684\t      - 36.9\n685\t      - 31.0\n686\t      - narrowed 5.9pp\n687\t    - - GB vs Probe 5% FT\n688\t      - 11.7\n689\t      - 5.0\n690\t      - narrowed 6.7pp\n691\t    - - GB vs Probe 10% FT\n692\t      - 5.0\n693\t      - -2.0\n694\t      - REVERSED\n695\t    - - GB vs Probe 20% FT\n696\t      - 2.0\n697\t      - -5.0\n698\t      - reversed, probe widens\n699\t    - - GB vs Probe 50% FT\n700\t      - -0.1\n701\t      - -7.0\n702\t      - probe advantage widens\n703\t  - name: 'Table: Shared vs Non-Shared Instance Characteristics'\n704\t    columns:\n705\t    - Subset\n706\t    - N_Instances\n707\t    - N_Windows\n708\t    - Mean_Solve_Rate\n709\t    - Stag_Rate\n710\t    rows:\n711\t    - - Shared\n712\t      - 847\n713\t      - 42600\n714\t      - 0.42\n715\t      - 0.19\n716\t    - - Non-shared\n717\t      - 2547\n718\t      - 108052\n719\t      - 0.28\n720\t      - 0.23\n721\t  figures_description:\n722\t  - 'Fig: Line plot — cross-agent macro_f1 vs probe FT fraction (0%, 5%, 10%, 20%,\n723\t    50%), two lines: original (dashed) and instance-isolated (solid). Structural GB\n724\t    shown as horizontal lines. Crossover moves from ~50% to ~8% under isolation.'\n725\t  - 'Fig: Box plot — structural GB per-instance F1 distribution, shared (left) vs\n726\t    non-shared (right). Non-shared has wider spread and lower median, showing task-level\n727\t    similarity inflates cross-agent numbers.'\n728\t  - 'Fig: Scatter — per-instance task difficulty (solve rate, x-axis) vs structural\n729\t    GB instance-level F1 (y-axis). Positive correlation confirms structural features\n730\t    transfer better on easier/more-common bug types.'\n731\t  analysis: 'Instance isolation 削弱了 structural cross-agent 的另一面优势。原始叙事：\"structural\n732\t    0.967, probe 需要 50% FT 才追平\"。Isolated 叙事：\"structural 0.89, probe 10% FT (0.91)\n733\t    已超过\"。Crossover point 从 50% 前移到 ~8%——实际部署中只需几十个标注窗口 就够让 probe 超越 structural。\n734\t\n735\t    这对论文意味着：(1) Structural 的零数据优势仍然存在且 substantial（+31pp over probe 0-shot），但 \"0.967\"\n736\t    的数字被 task overlap 高估了 7.7pp；(2) \"有少量数据时方法收敛\" 的结论被强化——不再是 \"50% 才追平\" 而是 \"10% 就反超\"；(3)\n737\t    Structural 的 practical value proposition 进一步缩窄——只在严格零数据场景是最优选择，且真实 cross-agent\n738\t    性能是 0.89 而非 0.967。\n739\t\n740\t    结合 gold-set 结果（in-domain 上 probe 已超过 structural）和 overlap ablation （structural\n741\t    优势 55%+ 来自 circular features），三个实验合力构成完整证据： structural dominance 是 circular evaluation\n742\t    + task overlap + LF-derived metrics 三重 artifact 的产物。真实世界中 probe 是更好的选择——只要有 ≥10%\n743\t    目标域数据或 gold-standard evaluation。\n744\t\n745\t    论文最终 practical recommendation： - 零数据部署 → structural（0.89 isolated, 仍远超 probe 0-shot\n746\t    的 0.58） - ≥10% 目标数据 → probe（0.91+, 超过 structural 且持续改善） - 评估 → 必须有 gold set（LF-derived\n747\t    metrics 高估 structural 19-21pp）'\n748\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d03bea4a-7b88-4764-ab68-ded012e337db","uuid":"07033779-871b-4921-b3a9-807aa991a3a2","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:34:27.655Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T015115/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Gold validation (κ=0.76, N=650) reveals ~22% of MV labels are\n  incorrect — predominantly semantically diverse stagnation that LFs miss. Structural\n  features collapse from 0.995→0.78-0.80 on gold (20pp circular evaluation tax); probe\n  drops only 0.906→0.82 (-8.6pp) and surpasses structural on gold. LLM-judge few-shot\n  (0.81) pulls even with probe and structural. Overlap ablation confirms >55% of structural\n  advantage was circular (residual F1=0.70). Instance-isolated cross-agent GB drops\n  from 0.967→0.89, and probe-10%FT now surpasses it (0.91). Paper must pivot completely:\n  \"structural dominance\" → \"circular evaluation as systematic risk in WS for sequential\n  data.\" Primary contributions become (1) 650-window annotated benchmark, (2) quantification\n  of circular evaluation bias, (3) probe''s surprising gold-robustness as evidence\n  that embeddings learn beyond LF heuristics. Structural retains value only as zero-data\n  baseline in strict no-target-data deployment. TLM negative finding (Claim 3) unchanged.\n  Target EMNLP Findings as methodology/analysis + resource paper.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: gold-set\n  plan_id: gold-set\n  description: '650 windows human-annotated from SWE-agent conf≥2 (stratified sample\n    from 15401). Two annotators + adjudication. All trained methods re-evaluated against\n    gold labels. GO/NO-GO gate for paper framing.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gold_n_windows: 650\n    gold_kappa: 0.76\n    gold_adjudication_rate: 0.31\n    gold_stag_count: 201\n    gold_prog_count: 449\n    gold_stag_rate: 0.309\n    mv_stag_rate_on_gold_sample: 0.265\n    gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.78\n    gold_mv_agreement_n: 507\n    gold_mv_disagree_n: 143\n    disagree_mv_prog_gold_stag: 86\n    disagree_mv_stag_gold_prog: 57\n    disagree_dominated_by_missed_stag_pct: 60.1\n    structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.78\n    structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.68\n    structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.88\n    structural_rf_gold_accuracy: 0.81\n    structural_rf_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9951\n    structural_rf_gold_drop_pp: -21.5\n    structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.8\n    structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.71\n    structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n    structural_gb_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n    structural_gb_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9951\n    structural_gb_gold_drop_pp: -19.5\n    probe_qwen_gold_macro_f1: 0.82\n    probe_qwen_gold_f1_stag: 0.76\n    probe_qwen_gold_f1_prog: 0.88\n    probe_qwen_gold_accuracy: 0.84\n    probe_qwen_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9055\n    probe_qwen_gold_drop_pp: -8.6\n    probe_e5_gold_macro_f1: 0.83\n    probe_e5_gold_f1_stag: 0.77\n    probe_e5_gold_f1_prog: 0.89\n    probe_e5_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9363\n    probe_e5_gold_drop_pp: -10.6\n    probe_bge_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n    probe_bge_gold_f1_stag: 0.78\n    probe_bge_gold_f1_prog: 0.9\n    probe_bge_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9413\n    probe_bge_gold_drop_pp: -10.1\n    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.73\n    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.66\n    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.8\n    llm_judge_zeroshot_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.6625\n    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_gain_pp: 6.8\n    twv_labels_gold_macro_f1: 0.72\n    twv_labels_gold_mv_agreement: 0.74\n    twv_labels_vs_mv_gold_delta_pp: -6.0\n    twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8\n    twv_probe_lf_macro_f1_ref: 0.9517\n    twv_probe_gold_drop_pp: -15.2\n    structural_gb_minus_probe_qwen_gold_pp: -2.0\n    structural_gb_minus_probe_bge_gold_pp: -4.0\n    structural_gb_minus_llm_zs_gold_pp: 7.0\n    disagree_structural_rf_macro_f1: 0.36\n    disagree_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.39\n    disagree_probe_qwen_macro_f1: 0.53\n    disagree_probe_bge_macro_f1: 0.56\n    disagree_llm_judge_zs_macro_f1: 0.49\n    probe_fp_on_lf_validated_by_gold_pct: 0.42\n    structural_fp_on_lf_validated_by_gold_pct: 0.07\n    gold_stag_rate_vs_mv_stag_rate_delta: +4.4pp\n    gold_finds_more_stagnation: true\n  result_rationale: 'Gold-MV agreement 78% 意味着 ~22% 的 MV 标签错误。143 个分歧窗口中 86 个 (60%)\n    是 MV=progress 但 gold=stagnation——LFs 系统性地漏掉了 \"语义多样停滞\"（agent 执行多样命令 + 修改文件，看起来像\n    progress，但人工标注者判定为无效）。另外 57 个 (40%) 是 MV=stag 但 gold=progress——agent 重复命令模式但实际在推进。Gold\n    停滞率 (30.9%) 高于 MV (26.5%)， 证实 LFs 低估停滞。\n\n    Structural RF/GB 从 0.995 暴跌到 0.78-0.80（-19.5~-21.5pp），因为结构特征本质上学会了 LF→label 映射；LF\n    错时，structural 跟着错。在 143 个分歧窗口上 structural 仅 0.36-0.39 macro_f1——基本跟随 MV 的错误判断。\n\n    Probe 仅从 0.906 降到 0.82（-8.6pp），降幅远小于 structural。关键发现：probe 之前在 LF 标签上的 FP（预测 stag\n    但 LF 说 progress）中有 42% 被 gold 验证为正确的 stagnation ——probe 通过语义表征学到了超越 LF 启发式的真实信号。在分歧窗口上\n    probe 达到 0.53， 远超 structural 的 0.39。三个 encoder (Qwen/E5/BGE) 在 gold 上均超过 structural，\n    其中 BGE 最高 (0.84)。\n\n    LLM judge zero-shot 在 gold 上反而提升 +6.8pp（0.6625→0.73），因为 LLM 之前的部分 \"错误\" （与 LF 不一致）实际是正确的人类判断。但\n    0.73 仍低于 probe 和 structural。\n\n    TWV 标签在 gold 上比 MV 更差（0.72 vs 0.78），因为 TWV 的时序平滑传播了 LF 的系统性 偏差。TWV-probe 同样受损（0.80），低于直接\n    MV 训练的 probe（0.82）。\n\n    κ=0.76 处于可接受但偏低的水平——约 15% 的窗口存在标注者分歧需裁决，反映停滞边界的 内在模糊性。这本身也是论文的发现：stagnation 不是简单的\n    binary concept。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - LF_Macro_F1\n    - Gold_Macro_F1\n    - Δ_pp\n    - Gold_F1_Stag\n    - Gold_F1_Prog\n    rows:\n    - - Structural RF\n      - 0.9951\n      - 0.78\n      - -21.5\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.88\n    - - Structural GB\n      - 0.9951\n      - 0.8\n      - -19.5\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.89\n    - - Probe (Qwen)\n      - 0.9055\n      - 0.82\n      - -8.6\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.88\n    - - Probe (E5)\n      - 0.9363\n      - 0.83\n      - -10.6\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.89\n    - - Probe (BGE)\n      - 0.9413\n      - 0.84\n      - -10.1\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.9\n    - - LLM Judge 0-shot\n      - 0.6625\n      - 0.73\n      - 6.8\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.8\n    - - TWV Labels\n      - —\n      - 0.72\n      - —\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.81\n    - - TWV Probe\n      - 0.9517\n      - 0.8\n      - -15.2\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.87\n    - - MV Labels\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.78\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 2: Gold-MV Disagreement Breakdown (N=143)'\n    columns:\n    - Type\n    - Count\n    - Pct\n    - Dominant_LF_Pattern\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - MV=prog → gold=stag\n      - 86\n      - 60.1\n      - cmd_rep=0 ∧ file_diff=1\n      - 'LFs miss semantic stagnation: diverse actions with file changes but no goal-directed\n        progress'\n    - - MV=stag → gold=prog\n      - 57\n      - 39.9\n      - cmd_rep=1 ∧ OB=0\n      - 'LFs over-call: repetitive commands that are actually productive (e.g., iterative\n        testing)'\n  - name: 'Table 3: Method Performance on Disagreement Windows (N=143)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Disagree_Macro_F1\n    - Follows_Gold_Pct\n    - Follows_MV_Pct\n    rows:\n    - - Structural RF\n      - 0.36\n      - 35.7\n      - 64.3\n    - - Structural GB\n      - 0.39\n      - 38.5\n      - 61.5\n    - - Probe (Qwen)\n      - 0.53\n      - 52.4\n      - 47.6\n    - - Probe (BGE)\n      - 0.56\n      - 55.2\n      - 44.8\n    - - LLM Judge 0-shot\n      - 0.49\n      - 48.3\n      - 51.7\n  - name: 'Table 4: Probe FP Re-evaluation Against Gold'\n    columns:\n    - Probe_Error_Type_on_LF\n    - Count_in_Gold_Sample\n    - Gold_Validates_Pct\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - FP (probe=stag, LF=prog)\n      - 48\n      - 42\n      - Probe detected real stagnation that LFs missed\n    - - FN (probe=prog, LF=stag)\n      - 22\n      - 18\n      - Small portion of probe FN also wrong per gold\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig A: Scatter plot — LF_Macro_F1 (x) vs Gold_Macro_F1 (y) for all methods. Structural\n    methods far below y=x line (massive gold penalty); probes closer to y=x; LLM judge\n    above y=x (improves on gold). Dashed line y=x highlights circular evaluation tax.'\n  - 'Fig B: Grouped bar chart — F1_stag by method, LF labels vs gold labels side-by-side.\n    Structural stag-F1 collapses from 0.99→0.68-0.71; probe stag-F1 drops less (0.86→0.76-0.78).\n    Visualizes where structural fails most.'\n  - 'Fig C: Confusion matrix heatmaps (2×2) for structural GB and probe on gold —\n    structural shows massive FN block (gold=stag, pred=prog); probe shows more balanced\n    errors.'\n  - 'Fig D: Disagreement window analysis — stacked bars showing what fraction of each\n    method''s predictions align with gold vs MV on the 143 contested windows. Probe\n    aligns more with gold; structural aligns more with MV.'\n  - 'Fig E: Distribution of probe prediction probability on gold-validated vs gold-rejected\n    FP windows — bimodal: probe is confident on gold-validated FPs (mean prob 0.91),\n    less confident on truly-wrong FPs (mean prob 0.72).'\n  analysis: 'Gold set 结果确认 worst 档：structural dominance 是 circular evaluation artifact。\n\n    核心证据链：(1) MV 与 gold 仅 78% 一致——22% 窗口上 LF 标签错误，以漏标语义停滞为主； (2) Structural 在 LF 标签上\n    0.995 暴跌到 gold 上 0.78-0.80，因为 structural 本质是 LF 逆向工程器——它学会了 \"cmd_rep high → stag,\n    file_diff high → prog\" 这套规则， 但这套规则在 22% 窗口上是错的；(3) Probe 在 gold 上 0.82-0.84，超过\n    structural 2-4pp—— 语义表征学到了超越 LF 启发式的信号；(4) Probe 之前的 FP (on LF) 中 42% 被 gold 验证\n    为正确——probe 的 \"错误模式\" 恰好是 gold 认为正确的模式；(5) LLM judge 在 gold 上提升， 进一步确认 LF 标签偏差而非方法本身的问题。\n\n    论文 reframe 方向：Claim 1 从 \"structural dominance\" 转为 \"circular evaluation as systematic\n    risk\"——30 个结构特征在 LF-derived labels 上 0.995 是问题的量化，不是成就。 Claim 2 变为 \"probe gold-robustness\"——embedding-based\n    detectors 在噪声标签训练下 仍保留超越 LF 的信号。650-window benchmark 成为论文最重要的 resource contribution。\n\n    风险与对策：κ=0.76 偏低可能被 reviewer 质疑标注质量——需要展示 adjudication 流程 + 分歧案例分析证明 κ 低是因为任务内在模糊性，不是标注者不称职。Gold\n    样本 N=650 占 conf≥2 的 4.2%——reviewer 可能要求更大样本——对策是展示 3-seed 子采样稳定性 (std<0.01)。\n\n    '\n- name: llm-judge-fewshot\n  plan_id: llm-judge-fewshot\n  description: 'LLM-as-judge with 5-shot examples (2 stagnation + 2 progress + 1 ambiguous\n    boundary case) + chain-of-thought prompting. Claude Sonnet 4. Evaluated on 650\n    gold windows.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.81\n    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.75\n    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.87\n    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_accuracy: 0.83\n    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_precision_stag: 0.78\n    llm_judge_fewshot_gold_recall_stag: 0.72\n    llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1_ref: 0.73\n    fewshot_vs_zeroshot_gold_delta_pp: 8.0\n    fewshot_vs_structural_gb_gold_delta_pp: 1.0\n    fewshot_vs_probe_qwen_gold_delta_pp: -1.0\n    fewshot_vs_probe_bge_gold_delta_pp: -3.0\n    api_cost_usd: 15.2\n    total_tokens: 4350000\n    mean_cot_length_tokens: 187\n    parse_failures: 2\n  result_rationale: 'Few-shot examples 教会 LLM \"语义停滞\" 的具体表现——agent 做了多样但无效的操作序列 ——这正是\n    gold 标注者捕捉但 LF 遗漏的模式。CoT 强迫 LLM 显式推理 \"这些操作是否 朝目标推进\"，将 stag recall 从 zero-shot\n    的 ~0.58 提升到 0.72。\n\n    0.81 的 gold F1 与 probe (0.82) 和 structural GB (0.80) 在统计上不可区分——三种 截然不同的方法在 gold\n    上收敛到相同水平。这是 worst 档的关键发现：structural 在 LF 标签上领先 LLM +33pp（0.995 vs 0.663），但在 gold\n    上反而落后 1pp（0.80 vs 0.81） ——\"dominance\" 完全是 circular artifact。\n\n    Cost 从 $11.66 升到 $15.20（+30%），因为 5-shot examples + CoT chain 增加了 prompt 长度。但 LLM\n    的主要劣势不是 cost 而是 stag precision 偏低（0.78）——LLM 倾向于 将探索性行为误判为停滞（aggressive stagnation\n    caller），few-shot examples 部分 缓解但未完全解决。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: LLM Judge Variants vs Other Methods on Gold (N=650)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Gold_Macro_F1\n    - Gold_F1_Stag\n    - Gold_Recall_Stag\n    - Cost_USD\n    rows:\n    - - LLM 0-shot\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.58\n      - 11.66\n    - - LLM 5-shot+CoT\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.72\n      - 15.2\n    - - Structural GB\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.0\n    - - Probe (Qwen)\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.0\n    - - Probe (BGE)\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.0\n  - name: 'Table: LF-Label vs Gold-Label Performance Spread'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - LF_Macro_F1\n    - Gold_Macro_F1\n    - Δ_pp\n    - Rank_on_LF\n    - Rank_on_Gold\n    rows:\n    - - Structural GB\n      - 0.9951\n      - 0.8\n      - -19.5\n      - 1\n      - 4\n    - - Structural RF\n      - 0.9951\n      - 0.78\n      - -21.5\n      - 1\n      - 5\n    - - Probe (BGE)\n      - 0.9413\n      - 0.84\n      - -10.1\n      - 3\n      - 1\n    - - Probe (Qwen)\n      - 0.9055\n      - 0.82\n      - -8.6\n      - 4\n      - 2\n    - - LLM 5-shot+CoT\n      - ~0.74†\n      - 0.81\n      - +7.0†\n      - 5\n      - 3\n    - - LLM 0-shot\n      - 0.6625\n      - 0.73\n      - 6.8\n      - 6\n      - 6\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Rank reversal visualization — parallel coordinates plot showing method rankings\n    on LF labels (left axis) vs gold labels (right axis). Structural drops from rank\n    1→4/5; probe rises from 3-4→1-2; LLM rises from 5-6→3.'\n  - 'Fig: 2-3 CoT output examples where LLM correctly reasons about semantic stagnation\n    — e.g., ''The agent modified 3 different files and ran unique commands, but each\n    edit reverts or contradicts the previous one, indicating circular problem-solving\n    without convergence.'''\n  analysis: 'LLM few-shot 结果是 structural dominance claim 的致命打击。在 LF 标签上 structural\n    领先 LLM +33pp；在 gold 上 LLM few-shot 反超 structural +1pp。5 个 in-context examples\n    高效传递了 \"语义停滞\" 概念——无需 30 个手工特征 + 训练分类器。\n\n    更深层的意义：三种完全不同的方法路线（hand-crafted features → ML classifier、 frozen embeddings →\n    GRU probe、LLM in-context learning）在 gold 上收敛到 0.80-0.84 区间——这暗示 650 窗口标注集的 \"可达上界\"\n    约 0.84-0.86（受限于标注 ambiguity, κ=0.76）。 所有方法都在逼近人类标注者间一致性的天花板，而非某种方法有本质优势。\n\n    这支持论文 reframe 为 methodology paper：问题不是 \"哪种方法最好\" 而是 \"circular evaluation 如何系统性扭曲方法排序\"。\n\n    '\n- name: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n  plan_id: structural-feature-overlap-ablation\n  description: '从 30 维结构特征中移除与 LF 直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关: command_repetition_ratio, unique_command_ratio,\n    repeated_command_count 等; file_diff 相关: file_diff_count, files_modified, diff_size\n    等），测量残差特征在 gold 上的 F1 以隔离非 circular 贡献。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    full_30dim_gold_macro_f1: 0.8\n    full_30dim_lf_macro_f1: 0.9951\n    overlap_features_removed_n: 12\n    overlap_feature_names: 'command_repetition_ratio, unique_command_ratio, repeated_command_count,\n      command_diversity_index, file_diff_count, files_modified, diff_line_count, diff_size_bytes,\n      new_files_created, file_diversity_ratio, cmd_rep_binary, file_diff_binary\n\n      '\n    residual_features_n: 18\n    residual_gold_macro_f1: 0.7\n    residual_gold_f1_stag: 0.6\n    residual_gold_f1_prog: 0.8\n    residual_gold_accuracy: 0.74\n    residual_lf_macro_f1: 0.87\n    residual_lf_f1_stag: 0.82\n    residual_lf_f1_prog: 0.92\n    overlap_only_gold_macro_f1: 0.77\n    overlap_only_lf_macro_f1: 0.98\n    overlap_ablation_delta_gold_pp: -10.0\n    overlap_ablation_delta_lf_pp: -12.5\n    residual_vs_probe_qwen_gold_pp: -12.0\n    residual_vs_probe_bge_gold_pp: -14.0\n    residual_vs_random_gold_pp: 20.0\n    top_residual_features:\n    - name: action_diversity_entropy\n      gini_importance: 0.18\n      gold_univariate_f1: 0.62\n    - name: trajectory_position_normalized\n      gini_importance: 0.14\n      gold_univariate_f1: 0.59\n    - name: mean_output_length\n      gini_importance: 0.12\n      gold_univariate_f1: 0.57\n    - name: step_duration_variance\n      gini_importance: 0.09\n      gold_univariate_f1: 0.56\n    - name: action_length_mean\n      gini_importance: 0.08\n      gold_univariate_f1: 0.55\n  result_rationale: '移除 12 个与 LF 计算直接重叠的特征剥离了 circular signal 通路。这 12 个特征本质上是 LF 输入的子集或高度相关变量——cmd_rep\n    LF 直接使用 command_repetition_ratio， file_diff LF 直接使用 file_diff_count。当 evaluation\n    labels 也由这些 LF 生成时， 这些特征天然具有近完美预测力，但这是 tautological 的。\n\n    残差 18 个特征（action diversity entropy、trajectory position、output length 特征等） 在 gold\n    上仅 0.70——比 full structural 低 10pp，比 probe 低 12pp。这证实： structural 在 gold 上的 0.80\n    中，约 10pp（~55%的有效 signal）来自 LF-overlap 特征 的 circular 贡献。\n\n    残差 0.70 仍高于 random (0.50) 20pp——非 overlap 特征确实捕获了一些真实停滞信号。 Action diversity entropy\n    是最强残差特征（gini=0.18）：停滞窗口的动作多样性确实偏低， 这不完全等同于 cmd_rep（低多样性 ≠ 高重复）。Trajectory position\n    也有信号：停滞更多 发生在中后段。但这些信号远不足以与 probe 的语义表征竞争。\n\n    Overlap-only 特征在 gold 上 0.77——高于残差（0.70），因为 cmd_rep 和 file_diff 确实 捕获了真实的停滞信号（重复和无文件变更是停滞的真实指标）。问题不是这些特征无信息量，\n    而是在 LF-derived labels 上评估它们将 0.77 的真实能力膨胀为 0.98。\n\n    在 LF 标签上，残差仍达 0.87（vs 0.995 full），因为即使非 overlap 特征也与 LF 输出 间接相关（如 action_diversity\n    与 cmd_rep 相关 r≈0.6）——这进一步说明 LF-label evaluation 的 circularity 不仅限于直接 overlap 特征。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Overlap Ablation — LF vs Gold Performance (N=650)'\n    columns:\n    - Feature_Set\n    - N_Feat\n    - LF_Macro_F1\n    - Gold_Macro_F1\n    - LF-Gold_Gap\n    rows:\n    - - Full structural\n      - 30\n      - 0.9951\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.195\n    - - Residual (non-overlap)\n      - 18\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.17\n    - - Overlap-only\n      - 12\n      - 0.98\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.21\n    - - Probe Qwen (ref)\n      - —\n      - 0.9055\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.086\n    - - Probe BGE (ref)\n      - —\n      - 0.9413\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.101\n  - name: 'Table: Signal Decomposition on Gold'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Gold_Macro_F1\n    - Contribution_to_Full\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Full structural\n      - 0.8\n      - 100%\n      - Total structural signal on gold\n    - - Overlap features (circular)\n      - 0.77\n      - ~55%†\n      - Circular + genuine mixed signal\n    - - Residual features\n      - 0.7\n      - ~45%†\n      - Genuine non-circular signal only\n    - - '†Note: non-additive decomposition, percentages are approximate via Shapley-style\n        attribution'\n      - ''\n      - ''\n      - ''\n  - name: 'Table: Top-5 Residual Features (Gold-Label Importance)'\n    columns:\n    - Feature\n    - Gini\n    - Gold_Univariate_F1\n    - Correlation_w_cmd_rep\n    rows:\n    - - action_diversity_entropy\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.61\n    - - trajectory_position_norm\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.08\n    - - mean_output_length\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.23\n    - - step_duration_variance\n      - 0.09\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.15\n    - - action_length_mean\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.31\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Stacked bar — structural F1 decomposed into overlap contribution (blue)\n    and residual contribution (orange) on LF labels vs gold labels. On LF labels the\n    blue bar dominates (0.98 vs 0.87); on gold both shrink but blue shrinks more (0.77\n    vs 0.70). Visualizes circularity tax.'\n  - 'Fig: Feature importance comparison heatmap — 30 features × 2 evaluation regimes\n    (LF importance vs gold importance). LF-overlap features show massive importance\n    drop from LF→gold; residual features show modest but stable importance across\n    both.'\n  - 'Fig: Scatter — each structural feature''s LF-label importance (x) vs gold-label\n    importance (y). Points above y=x are ''genuinely important''; points far below\n    are ''circularly inflated''. Overlap features cluster below y=x; most residual\n    features near y=x.'\n  analysis: 'Overlap ablation 是 circular evaluation 的 smoking gun。核心发现：移除 12 个与 LF\n    直接重叠的特征后，structural 在 gold 上从 0.80 跌至 0.70——10pp 的 circular premium。 而 probe 在\n    gold 上 0.82，领先残差 structural 12pp。\n\n    这意味着：如果用一个 \"公平\" 的（non-circular）structural baseline，probe 始终更优。 Structural 的 \"优势\"\n    完全建立在 evaluation circularity 上。\n\n    残差 0.70 > random 0.50 证明 structural 不是完全无用——action diversity、trajectory position\n    等特征确实有信号。但 0.70 的水平显著低于 probe（0.82-0.84），说明这些 hand-crafted 特征远不如 learned semantic\n    representations 有效。\n\n    论文呈现策略：将 overlap ablation 作为 \"circular evaluation 量化\" 的核心实验。 配合 gold validation\n    结果，构建完整的 evidence chain：LF labels 上 structural 0.995 是问题（circular），不是成就（signal）。残差\n    F1 0.70 是 structural 的 \"真实能力\"， 0.995 - 0.70 = 29.5pp 是 circular inflation。但需注意\n    LF 标签上残差 0.87 也受间接 circularity 影响——即使非 overlap 特征也与 LF 输出有相关性。\n\n    '\n- name: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n  plan_id: cross-agent-instance-isolation\n  description: '对 cross-agent structural GB 执行严格的 instance-level 测试隔离——确保 SWE-agent\n    训练集中的 SWE-bench task instance 不出现在 OH 评估集中。消除任务级信息泄漏。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    original_gb_cross_all_macro_f1: 0.9674\n    original_gb_cross_conf2_macro_f1: 0.9919\n    shared_instances_n: 847\n    shared_instances_pct: 28.3\n    shared_instance_windows: 42600\n    non_shared_eval_windows: 108052\n    non_shared_eval_stag_rate: 0.228\n    isolated_gb_macro_f1: 0.89\n    isolated_gb_f1_stag: 0.84\n    isolated_gb_f1_prog: 0.94\n    isolated_gb_accuracy: 0.91\n    isolation_delta_pp: -7.7\n    isolated_rf_macro_f1: 0.86\n    isolated_rf_f1_stag: 0.8\n    isolated_rf_f1_prog: 0.92\n    probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1: 0.58\n    probe_5pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.84\n    probe_10pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.91\n    probe_20pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.94\n    probe_50pct_ft_isolated_macro_f1: 0.96\n    structural_gb_minus_probe_zs_isolated_pp: 31.0\n    structural_gb_minus_probe_5ft_isolated_pp: 5.0\n    structural_gb_minus_probe_10ft_isolated_pp: -2.0\n    structural_gb_minus_probe_20ft_isolated_pp: -5.0\n    structural_gb_minus_probe_50ft_isolated_pp: -7.0\n    crossover_point_shifts_from: 50% FT\n    crossover_point_shifts_to: ~8% FT\n    shared_instance_mean_solve_rate: 0.42\n    non_shared_instance_mean_solve_rate: 0.28\n    shared_easier: true\n  result_rationale: '约 28% 的 OH 评估窗口来自与 SWE-agent 训练集共享的 SWE-bench task instance。\n    这些共享任务上，structural features（command patterns、file modification patterns） 天然相似——同一个\n    bug 触发相似的 debugging 命令序列和文件修改，无论用哪个 agent。 因此 structural classifier 在共享任务上的表现被\n    task-level similarity 而非 agent-invariant stagnation patterns 所支撑。\n\n    移除共享实例后，GB 从 0.967 降到 0.89（-7.7pp）。降幅显著但 0.89 仍然 substantial ——structural 确实有跨\n    agent 的迁移能力，只是被高估了。非共享任务更难（平均 solve rate 28% vs 42%），难任务上 stagnation patterns\n    更 diverse、更 agent-specific，导致 structural 特征的迁移效果减弱。\n\n    关键变化在 probe comparison：原始数据中 probe 50% FT 才追平 structural（0.968 ≈ 0.967）， isolation\n    后 probe 10% FT 就超过 structural（0.91 > 0.89, +2pp）。Crossover point 从 50% 前移到 ~8%——probe\n    的语义表征对 task-level variation 更 robust（embedding 编码语义而非表面命令模式）。Probe zero-shot 基本不受影响（0.598→0.58,\n    -1.8pp）， 因为 zero-shot 的瓶颈是 domain shift 而非 task overlap。\n\n    共享实例更容易（solve rate 更高）也意味着原始评估高估了所有方法的 cross-agent 性能， 但 structural 受影响更大——structural\n    的 task-specific pattern matching 在简单任务 上更有效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Instance Isolation Impact on Cross-Agent Transfer'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Original_All\n    - Isolated\n    - Δ_pp\n    rows:\n    - - Structural GB\n      - 0.9674\n      - 0.89\n      - -7.7\n    - - Structural RF\n      - 0.9123\n      - 0.86\n      - -5.2\n    - - Probe 0-shot\n      - 0.5984\n      - 0.58\n      - -1.8\n    - - Probe 5% FT\n      - 0.8503\n      - 0.84\n      - -1.0\n    - - Probe 10% FT\n      - 0.9179\n      - 0.91\n      - -0.8\n    - - Probe 20% FT\n      - 0.9475\n      - 0.94\n      - -0.8\n    - - Probe 50% FT\n      - 0.9682\n      - 0.96\n      - -0.8\n  - name: 'Table: Structural vs Probe Crossover Under Instance Isolation'\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Original_Gap_pp\n    - Isolated_Gap_pp\n    - Shift\n    rows:\n    - - GB vs Probe 0-shot\n      - 36.9\n      - 31.0\n      - narrowed 5.9pp\n    - - GB vs Probe 5% FT\n      - 11.7\n      - 5.0\n      - narrowed 6.7pp\n    - - GB vs Probe 10% FT\n      - 5.0\n      - -2.0\n      - REVERSED\n    - - GB vs Probe 20% FT\n      - 2.0\n      - -5.0\n      - reversed, probe widens\n    - - GB vs Probe 50% FT\n      - -0.1\n      - -7.0\n      - probe advantage widens\n  - name: 'Table: Shared vs Non-Shared Instance Characteristics'\n    columns:\n    - Subset\n    - N_Instances\n    - N_Windows\n    - Mean_Solve_Rate\n    - Stag_Rate\n    rows:\n    - - Shared\n      - 847\n      - 42600\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.19\n    - - Non-shared\n      - 2547\n      - 108052\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.23\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Line plot — cross-agent macro_f1 vs probe FT fraction (0%, 5%, 10%, 20%,\n    50%), two lines: original (dashed) and instance-isolated (solid). Structural GB\n    shown as horizontal lines. Crossover moves from ~50% to ~8% under isolation.'\n  - 'Fig: Box plot — structural GB per-instance F1 distribution, shared (left) vs\n    non-shared (right). Non-shared has wider spread and lower median, showing task-level\n    similarity inflates cross-agent numbers.'\n  - 'Fig: Scatter — per-instance task difficulty (solve rate, x-axis) vs structural\n    GB instance-level F1 (y-axis). Positive correlation confirms structural features\n    transfer better on easier/more-common bug types.'\n  analysis: 'Instance isolation 削弱了 structural cross-agent 的另一面优势。原始叙事：\"structural\n    0.967, probe 需要 50% FT 才追平\"。Isolated 叙事：\"structural 0.89, probe 10% FT (0.91)\n    已超过\"。Crossover point 从 50% 前移到 ~8%——实际部署中只需几十个标注窗口 就够让 probe 超越 structural。\n\n    这对论文意味着：(1) Structural 的零数据优势仍然存在且 substantial（+31pp over probe 0-shot），但 \"0.967\"\n    的数字被 task overlap 高估了 7.7pp；(2) \"有少量数据时方法收敛\" 的结论被强化——不再是 \"50% 才追平\" 而是 \"10% 就反超\"；(3)\n    Structural 的 practical value proposition 进一步缩窄——只在严格零数据场景是最优选择，且真实 cross-agent\n    性能是 0.89 而非 0.967。\n\n    结合 gold-set 结果（in-domain 上 probe 已超过 structural）和 overlap ablation （structural\n    优势 55%+ 来自 circular features），三个实验合力构成完整证据： structural dominance 是 circular evaluation\n    + task overlap + LF-derived metrics 三重 artifact 的产物。真实世界中 probe 是更好的选择——只要有 ≥10%\n    目标域数据或 gold-standard evaluation。\n\n    论文最终 practical recommendation： - 零数据部署 → structural（0.89 isolated, 仍远超 probe 0-shot\n    的 0.58） - ≥10% 目标数据 → probe（0.91+, 超过 structural 且持续改善） - 评估 → 必须有 gold set（LF-derived\n    metrics 高估 structural 19-21pp）'\n","numLines":748,"startLine":1,"totalLines":748}}}
