{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0178nUUBdsFbcQGmhE7sN1yj","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/paper/main.tex:21:\\newcommand{\\goldset}[1]{\\textcolor{blue}{[GOLD\\_SET: #1]}}\ndocs/paper/sections/analysis.tex:14:Second, a human-annotated gold set (\\S\\ref{sec:gold_set}) will provide definitive non-circular ground truth.\ndocs/paper/sections/related_work.tex:40:We mitigate this through cross-agent transfer evaluation, where the model is tested on a different agent's LF distribution, and through a pending human-annotated gold set (\\S\\ref{sec:gold_set}).\ndocs/paper/sections/introduction.tex:31:We note that in-domain evaluation uses silver labels (\\S\\ref{sec:circular}); cross-agent transfer and a pending gold set (\\S\\ref{sec:gold_set}) provide non-circular validation.\ndocs/paper/main.aux:988:\\newlabel{sec:gold_set}{{4.8}{11}{Gold Set Validation}{subsection.4.8}{}}\ndocs/paper/sections/limitations.tex:9:A 650-window gold set with a validated annotation pipeline is prepared but human annotation is pending.\ndocs/paper/sections/limitations.tex:10:\\goldset{Gold set validation pending.}\ndocs/paper/sections/experiments.tex:11:A human-annotated gold set provides the definitive non-circular evaluation (\\S\\ref{sec:gold_set}).\ndocs/paper/sections/experiments.tex:266:\\label{sec:gold_set}\ndocs/paper/sections/experiments.tex:267:\\goldset{Human-annotated gold set (650 windows) validation pending. Results will be added upon completion (expected 2026-05-17). This provides the non-circular ground truth evaluation for all methods.}\ndocs/paper/sections/conclusion.tex:24:Future work includes extending evaluation to non-software-engineering agent domains, online integration with early termination or strategy switching, scaling to {>}10 labeling functions to test whether temporal aggregation becomes useful, and validation against the pending 650-window gold set.\ndocs/paper/sections/abstract.tex:6:[Omitted long matching line]\ndocs/paper/sections/abstract.tex:12:\\goldset{Gold set validation (650 windows) pending.}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PTzEvuF3MgnKCiVzABa5ew","session_id":"d03bea4a-7b88-4764-ab68-ded012e337db","uuid":"07c46b52-a94a-46a4-82a0-4f7783491e21","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:36:19.539Z"}
