{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011UK2EoMnRhjWKzjVnH9S6Z","type":"tool_result","content":"docs/paper/sections/introduction.tex:13:Second, \\emph{step-level scoring} via process reward models \\citep{xi2025agentprm} evaluates individual actions in isolation, discarding the window-level temporal dynamics that distinguish transient setbacks from sustained stagnation---a distinction that requires reasoning over sequences of consecutive actions \\citep{chen2025monitoring}."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PTzEvuF3MgnKCiVzABa5ew","session_id":"d03bea4a-7b88-4764-ab68-ded012e337db","uuid":"37990402-6ec1-41b1-82eb-0c3dc8557c3d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T02:36:20.926Z"}
